      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Describe the occasion in **Occasion Brief**.\n3. Press **Run**. Three image models draw a candidate each, and Jev picks one.\n4. The chosen image is saved under `occasion/approved`, or `occasion/review` when Jev is unsure."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
