      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Candidate 1**, **Candidate 2**, and **Candidate 3** use three of the newest image models on the same brief. **Describe the Candidates** looks at all three in one request and describes each by number.\n\nJev reads the brief and the descriptions. **Best Candidate** picks one, and its position chooses the image in **Chosen Image**. **Ready to Send** decides whether it can go to the client as it is.\n\nFive paid requests per run. Prices are in **OpenRouter models**; each request's charge is at openrouter.ai/activity."
      ],
      "title": "Using This Workflow"
    },
